\item An uncertainty \strong{score} turns each row of probabilities into one
number. Lower is better (more confident), see \code{\link[=uncert_lc]{uncert_lc()}},
\code{\link[=uncert_margin]{uncert_margin()}}, \code{\link[=uncert_entropy]{uncert_entropy()}} and \code{\link[=uncert_custom]{uncert_custom()}}.
